#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2244 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "Absent-column pin for the machine-derived guard (EC-43). TSVCDREF is NOT declared, so the loader's derived var_exists(\"TSVCDREF\") conjunct is false, so the rule EXECUTES and stays silent instead of firing on an all-missing column. expect=noViolation before the phase-4 hoist, now skipped: nothing in Scope gates this rule on TSVCDREF. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM   type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | FCNTRY | Planned Country of Investigational Sites | USA | USA
